Which of the following gives the length of the curve defined by

$$
\begin{aligned}
x&=t^{3} + t^{2} + 3\\
y&=t^{3} - t^{2}
\end{aligned}
$$

from $t=-1$ to $t=1$?

Choose an integral expression valid on the entire interval. Do not evaluate it.

